		{"id":"d6d506c76915c7a7","type":"group","x":-2020,"y":-2380,"width":340,"height":420,"label":"Mercenary Groups"},
		{"id":"90a2fe46c61484f1","type":"text","text":"Signs deal with [[International Government]], formally making the [[Chromatic Organization]] a much bigger entity","x":-240,"y":1173,"width":367,"height":155},
		{"id":"23d542904c23821b","type":"text","text":"[[Chromatic Station|Chromatic Stations]] develop over time, operations turn international","x":180,"y":1173,"width":280,"height":155},
		{"id":"983b3d59181767c2","type":"text","text":"Government catches onto the underground group, realizes the former lead researcher is essentially in charge of the group","x":-620,"y":1173,"width":340,"height":207},
		{"id":"da5e29d370d716fb","type":"text","text":"Meet together in law firm, very combative/chaotic interactions","x":-1320,"y":-1420,"width":340,"height":120},
		{"id":"c59aea4a1161c240","type":"text","text":"Raine agrees to steal belongings of a coworker from the coworker's ex's house","x":-700,"y":-1340,"width":360,"height":140},
		{"id":"b560fbf7be5bb570","type":"text","text":"Finds out/suspects that the Chroma is seen by other division team members","x":-1860,"y":1182,"width":340,"height":140},
		{"id":"7945ed644b7bd3f9","type":"text","text":"Kills his division, steals own replicable copies of confidential research, destroys lab and traces of new research, goes on the run","x":-1480,"y":1160,"width":395,"height":180},
		{"id":"ee6936dacfbe1c75","type":"text","text":"Finds an underground group of assassins willing to try the developed [[Serums]], said group becomes extremely successful","x":-1020,"y":1161,"width":357,"height":180},
		{"id":"9835fe6359df51a4","type":"text","text":"Promoted to Head of a Biotech Division","x":-2540,"y":1205,"width":260,"height":93},
		{"id":"05bff72a59844ac1","type":"text","text":"Discovers the 6 forms of Chroma","x":-2180,"y":1205,"width":250,"height":93},
		{"id":"961bc6b631edfa94","type":"text","text":"Begins researching vision with leads to [[Chroma]] independently","x":-2940,"y":1381,"width":320,"height":119},
		{"id":"6951534d541ebe2b","type":"text","text":"Develops romantic relationship with coworker's ex, arrange a meetup in ex's house","x":-780,"y":-1520,"width":380,"height":140},
