		{"id":"a0e51edf8debbcd2","type":"text","text":"Joins [[International Government]] Research Team","x":-3280,"y":1180,"width":254,"height":140},
		{"id":"bbb361df4104c132","type":"text","text":"Raine gets attention of Chromatic organization after gaining notoriety, Chromatics org kidnaps Raine to have her work for them","x":2020,"y":-1400,"width":411,"height":180},
		{"id":"5a325bec81b0748d","type":"text","text":"Raine and ex develop romantic relationship and a partnership of breaking/entering and stealing from people for underground contracts","x":1120,"y":-1360,"width":449,"height":160},
		{"id":"a8cd5a28cbc1c53e","type":"text","text":"Ex asks Raine to go steal the stuff back, claiming that it was his, not knowing she was the one who stole it from him","x":320,"y":-1340,"width":389,"height":167},
